@startuml class-state
' UML sınıf diyagramı: State deseni — kurs yaşam döngüsü (#51; ADR-010).
' Sınıf, alan ve metot adları koddakiyle birebir; getter'lar gösterilmez. Tutarlılık tablosu PR #51'de.
' Render (Graphviz gerekmez, smetana yerleşimi; PNG ve SVG ayrı komutlarla):
'   java -Duser.language=en -Duser.country=US -jar plantuml.jar -tpng docs/diagrams/class-state.puml
'   java -Duser.language=en -Duser.country=US -jar plantuml.jar -tsvg docs/diagrams/class-state.puml

!pragma layout smetana
!include class-style.iuml

title Mini Udemy - Sınıf diyagramı: State (CourseState) — [[../adr/0010-state-kurs-durumu.md ADR-010]]

package "com.miniudemy.course.service" {
  class CourseLifecycleService <<service>> {
    + submit(courseId : Long, instructorId : Long) : CourseResponse
    + approve(courseId : Long) : CourseResponse
    + reject(courseId : Long, reason : String) : CourseResponse
    + unpublishOwn(courseId : Long, instructorId : Long, reason : String) : CourseResponse
    + unpublish(courseId : Long, reason : String) : CourseResponse
  }
}

package "com.miniudemy.course.domain" {
  class Course <<entity>> <<Context>> {
    - status : CourseStatus = CourseStatus.DRAFT
    - rejectionReason : String
    - unpublishReason : String
    + isPublished() : boolean
    + assertEditable() : void
    + assertLessonAddable() : void
    + assertContentUploadable(lesson : Lesson) : void
    + assertDeletable() : void
    + submit() : void
    + approve() : void
    + reject(reason : String) : void
    + unpublish(reason : String) : void
    - state() : CourseState
  }

  enum CourseStatus {
    DRAFT
    IN_REVIEW
    PUBLISHED
    UNPUBLISHED
    --
    - state : CourseState
    ~ state() : CourseState
  }

  interface CourseState <<sealed>> <<State>> {
    ~ status() : CourseStatus
    ~ assertEditable() : void
    ~ assertLessonAddable() : void
    ~ assertContentUploadable(replacing : boolean) : void
    ~ assertDeletable() : void
    ~ submit() : CourseStatus
    ~ approve() : CourseStatus
    ~ reject() : CourseStatus
    ~ unpublish() : CourseStatus
    ~ isPublished() : boolean
  }

  class DraftState <<final>> <<ConcreteState>> {
    {static} ~ INSTANCE : DraftState
    + status() : CourseStatus
    + assertEditable() : void
    + assertLessonAddable() : void
    + assertDeletable() : void
    + submit() : CourseStatus
  }

  class InReviewState <<final>> <<ConcreteState>> {
    {static} ~ INSTANCE : InReviewState
    + status() : CourseStatus
    + approve() : CourseStatus
    + reject() : CourseStatus
  }

  class PublishedState <<final>> <<ConcreteState>> {
    {static} ~ INSTANCE : PublishedState
    + status() : CourseStatus
    + assertLessonAddable() : void
    + unpublish() : CourseStatus
    + isPublished() : boolean
  }

  class UnpublishedState <<final>> <<ConcreteState>> {
    {static} ~ INSTANCE : UnpublishedState
    + status() : CourseStatus
    + assertEditable() : void
    + assertLessonAddable() : void
    + submit() : CourseStatus
  }

  class CourseStateException {
    + CourseStateException(message : String)
  }
}

package "com.miniudemy.common.exception" {
  abstract class ApiException
  class ConflictException
}

CourseLifecycleService ..> Course : course.submit() / approve() /\nreject(reason) / unpublish(reason)
Course --> "1" CourseStatus : status
Course ..> CourseState : state() = status.state()
CourseStatus --> "1" CourseState : state
CourseState <|.. DraftState
CourseState <|.. InReviewState
CourseState <|.. PublishedState
CourseState <|.. UnpublishedState
CourseState ..> CourseStateException : <<throw>>\n(varsayılan metotlar)
ApiException <|-- ConflictException
ConflictException <|-- CourseStateException

note right of CourseState
  <b>State</b>: varsayılan (default) metotlar
  geçişi reddeder ve <i>CourseStateException</i>
  (409) fırlatır; her durum sınıfı yalnız
  izin verdiği metodu override eder.
  Serviste <i>status</i> için if/switch yok.
end note

note bottom of InReviewState
  <b>Geçiş tablosu</b> (docs/architecture.md › Kurs durumları)
  DRAFT → submit() → IN_REVIEW
  IN_REVIEW → approve() → PUBLISHED
  IN_REVIEW → reject() → DRAFT (gerekçe: rejectionReason)
  PUBLISHED → unpublish() → UNPUBLISHED (unpublishReason)
  UNPUBLISHED → submit() → IN_REVIEW
end note

note bottom of CourseLifecycleService
  Diğer istemciler aynı Context metotlarını çağırır:
  CourseService.delete → assertDeletable()
  CourseService.update → Course.update → assertEditable()
  SectionService → assertEditable()
  LessonService → assertLessonAddable() / assertEditable()
  ContentLinkService → assertContentUploadable(lesson)
end note

@enduml
